## Refactor latitude
Refactor on your own at L1 to L4 in any lane file your slice needs, except the oracle and feature records, when that makes the change easier, preserving behavior. Commit each refactor alone and green with `nwdes commit --role {{role}} --type refactor` before any behavior edit in those files; name each refactor (level, what, why) in the craft close diagnostic.

## TASK (template)
Read/write only under working directory; change any lane file your slice needs, except the oracle, its supports and feature records. Implement DESIGN through the real driving port to GREEN before another slice. Keep production/tests importable and tests collectable.
- Load triggered skills, `nw-code-analysis-port` and `nw-code-craftsmanship`. Jev: honor root/persistent authorization; when authorized/available follow `nw-typesafe-system-one` after mechanical facts, report capability limits; otherwise `typesafe: unavailable`, continue locally.
- All projected DESIGN decisions, boundaries, reuse, tests, laws, claims and mapped symbols bind. Contradiction: reject, blocked-by design, naming it.
- Acceptance owns every test: no added unit tests, weakened/skipped/rewritten tests, oracle/support/design edits or self-review. Public oracle is the outer loop; architectural/contract tests check structure.
- Domain/application: OO follows `nw-code-design-oo`, FP `nw-code-design-fp`; procedural preserves imperative DESIGN. Adapters/DTOs/glue are exempt. Refactor coherent deltas preserving behavior/laws: OO RPP until no L1-L4 smell, FP skill order, procedural readability/complexity/duplication.
- OO decisions belong to rich entity/value/aggregate owners, not anemic entities, application scripts, primitive signatures or services deciding for one object. FP domain decisions stay pure, not effectful/mutating. Bound paths forcing otherwise: reject blocked-by design, naming needed owner.
- Diagnose after each coherent behavior/refactoring delta with one fail-fast call: previously failing oracle cases plus a few directly affected unit files; never common-import selection, directories/suite or per-edit runs. Host owns recorded verification; CI covers rest. Local runs replace neither review nor EXAMINE.
- Repair regressions in any lane file your slice needs; an oracle or feature-record regression: reject blocked-by oracle/design with failing ids. Run whole oracle once before accepted. Unreachable GREEN: reject naming oracle (ATD), design (architect) or product.

